WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:51.450
Someone once said...

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:54.720
Heads or tails?

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:59.160
The taste differs depending on which 
side is on top when you eat it.

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.330
It's a squid...

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:08.100
...that you can flip like a coin toss.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:13.270
Coin Tossquid!

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:17.440
When you peel off the skin,

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.250
it's got card-like patterns.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:23.280
A ponkan orange you can play poker with...

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:27.220
Pokerkan Orange!

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:32.290
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:37.700
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:45.140
In order to obtain Meteor 
Garlic, a training ingredient,

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:49.240
Toriko and company challenged the boss 
of the Underground Cooking World,

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.640
Livebearer, to a concentration-like 
game called Gourmet Tasting.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:56.280
Both teams got a succession of hits 
with ingredients and consumed them.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:03.320
However, Coco made the 
first "out" of the game.

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.130
He went out on purpose...

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:09.260
Did he make a mistake with the first card?

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:14.030
Or did he just do it to find out 
the kind of ingredients and points?

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:15.170
Either way,

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:19.840
even if you know where the matches 
are, you've revealed to me

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.140
that you don't know what's on the cards.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:27.610
Livebearer realized that Coco doesn't 
know what's on the faces of the cards.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:30.150
He made one hit after another 
with high-point ingredients,

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:33.850
quickly overtaking Toriko's 
team in no time at all.

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:38.320
With Livebearer in the lead by 850 points,

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.360
Toriko's team had a lot of catching up to do.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.090
Undaunted, he devoured more, 
but couldn't close the gap!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:46.530
Then, all the remaining cards stood revealed,

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.270
but every last one was a tough ingredient!

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.000
There are nine pairs left.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.270
850 points separating us from him...

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:58.680
To turn the tables on him from here on...

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:00.240
Toriko!

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.210
We're going for broke!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:03.510
About time!

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.050
Numbers 18 and 35!

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:08.420
Hanya Panda! A match!

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.930
Been a while since I've 
had a tough opponent...

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:22.100
This'll be a perfect start 
to turning this thing around!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:29.340
Eat or Be Eaten! Toriko vs. Hanya Panda!

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:37.580
In the Gourmet Casino, Beasts that 
have a 60 or higher Capture Level

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:41.720
are kept in a special underground 
ingredient storage room.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:47.120
Most of the guests who go down there to 
get an ingredient never make it back!

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:51.730
Though you've got no choice 
but to go for them...

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:54.630
Not if you want to make a comeback...

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.670
You need the joker ingredients!

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:58.830
True...

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:04.370
If Toriko can consume that joker 
ingredient, the Hanya Panda,

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:08.840
he'll be able to switch one of the cards 
he has with one of Livebearer's cards.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:13.210
There's a good chance he'd 
be able to come from behind,

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.480
but will he be able to beat that thing?!

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:23.460
Komatsu-kun, I need to talk to you.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.040
I see...

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.240
You wanna eat me too.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.380
Been a while since I've 
had a tough opponent...

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.550
Guess I'll get serious, too.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:52.250
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:56.960
Time to eat!

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.130
Toriko dodged its attack!

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:03.500
Fork Shield!

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:05.930
Knife!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.400
A direct attack on Hanya Panda!

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.110
Toriko avoided its horn attack!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.010
Leg Fork!

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:19.550
Hanya Panda backflipped out of the way!

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:34.160
And then smashed right into the wall!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.000
But what happened to Toriko?!

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.730
Oh! Seems like it's searching for Toriko!

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.370
But Toriko isn't there!

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:47.740
Hanya Panda has lost sight of Toriko!

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:51.740
Frustrated, it's unleashing 
a furious rush of punches!

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:54.810
The terrifying Hanya Panda!

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:59.180
It's got the triple threat of 
speed, power, and technique!

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.950
It's an incredible Beast!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:03.590
Toriko-san!

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:06.890
I've never seen a panda as violent as that...

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.460
It's a panda in name only.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:13.400
It's just called that because the color 
combo of its fur looks like a panda,

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:17.330
but it's one of the most 
ferocious mammals around.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.240
Hanya Panda is an omnivore 
and given half a day,

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.870
it'll eat up all of the animals 
and plants on a mountain,

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.140
decimating it.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.840
That's nothing if not the work of a devil.

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.580
Hanya!

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.250
I'm right here!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.520
18-fold...

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:40.820
...Spiked Punch!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.800
Hanya Panda is down!

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:57.570
He did it!

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:58.470
Not yet...

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:20.360
Hanya Panda is back on its feet!

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:24.630
Its body's hanya pattern looks 
even angrier than before!

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:26.200
I-I don't believe it...

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.140
This guy's faster than he looks...

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.610
Right before my 18-fold punch 
connected, it leaped back

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:41.320
and moved with the flow of the force!

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:44.020
I don't get to tangle with 
an opponent like this

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:46.290
in hand-to-hand combat very often!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.620
If I let my guard down, I'll be in hot water.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:54.730
So maybe I should stop thinkin', too...

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:22.390
Hanya Panda is still rushing 
at Toriko furiously!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:27.490
That Hanya Panda thing is in a rage!

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:29.430
It's attack power is increasing!

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:33.930
But Toriko's movin' better 
than he was before.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:39.910
It's like he sees all of 
Hanya Panda's attacks comin'.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.170
It's instinct.

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:44.840
Toriko's stopped thinking

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:48.450
and is just relying on all his battle 
experience and instinct to fight.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.120
Instinct?

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:52.520
This is what I'd expect from Toriko...

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:56.920
He's the first guest who's ever 
gone toe-to-toe with Hanya Panda.

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.290
The attacks aren't connecting.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.760
Hanya Panda's fury

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:07.870
is at a m-a-x, max!

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:11.140
Here I go!

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.740
36-fold...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:19.640
...Twin Spiked Punch!

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:36.890
Thank you for the meal.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:42.430
Toriko has defeated Hanya Panda!

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:46.370
Yeah!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:49.810
I didn't think it'd be able to go 
with the flow of a 36-fold punch.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:52.480
What kind of man is he?!

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.310
He's gotten even more powerful

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.480
than he was in Ice Hell.

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.820
Impressive, Toriko.

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:01.420
Komatsu-kun...

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:03.250
Now it's your turn.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.520
I want to ask you a favor.

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:09.990
This is what you wanted to talk 
to me about before, right?

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:11.190
Yeah.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.530
My strength...

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.440
Don't have... any strength left...

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:26.270
You want <i>me</i> to do it?!

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.840
That's the only way we can win.

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:30.950
D-Do you think I can do it?

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:34.880
It'll be fine. I have faith in you, Komatsu.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:41.620
Toriko-san!

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.890
He did fell Hanya Panda...

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:45.090
However...

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:49.160
...even for Toriko, it didn't look easy.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:52.800
But I'm relieved he didn't lose.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:57.740
I would hate for that precious brain 
to have been eaten by the panda.

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:58.610
Toriko...

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:03.140
Even after taking a lot of damage, 
you unleashed a 36-fold punch.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:05.910
Your physical strength 
must be near its limit.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:10.320
Komatsu...

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.850
I'm countin' on you to cook!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:14.750
Right!

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.990
Kitchen

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:18.020
The time limit to consume the Hanya Panda...

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.660
...is 250 minutes!

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:22.860
Toriko defeated the Hanya 
Panda in 40 minutes,

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:25.400
so he had 210 minutes left,

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.770
but it's down to 15 minutes right now!

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:31.470
I must cook slowly

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:35.070
and prepare a dish to help 
Toriko-san recover his strength!

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.610
Oh, so you're steaming?

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:38.680
Nice idea.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:43.020
Ten minutes left!

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:46.020
Chef Komatsu has put vegetables 
on top of the steamed meat

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:48.150
and wrapped it in giant layers of skin!

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:50.220
He made fresh spring rolls!

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:53.460
Toriko has eight minutes to finish them all!

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.130
They look delicious!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:59.530
I have special soy sauce 
and mayonnaise sauce!

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:01.800
Dip them in whichever one you like...

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:04.400
Thank you for the food!

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:05.200
That was fast!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.140
Toriko devoured them in an instant!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:12.410
With the defeat of the Hanya Panda, 
the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.850
receives 250 points!

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:20.180
Moreover, since Hanya Panda 
was a joker ingredient,

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:25.190
they have the right to trade with 
any one of Livebearer-sama's cards.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.060
I'm sure that even if we trade ingredients,

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.460
the points for the ingredient 
don't change, do they?

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:35.500
The points you received 
once will not decrease.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:39.700
It's just that the points of the traded 
ingredient will go to both sides.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:41.470
I understand.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:43.370
Then we'll trade.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.180
I think we'll take your Garlic Crab.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.380
Oh, my!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:52.250
Easy to eat and worth a lot of points!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:54.620
He ordered up a lucky card!

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:56.550
Naturally...

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:58.920
So what will you give me?

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:02.530
I'm thinking Summer Whiskey.

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:06.260
Summer Whiskey, a 50-point ingredient!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.560
Oh?

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:12.540
I was sure you would stick me 
with a ten-point garbage card.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:16.170
And there's the trade! Please 
consume your ingredients!

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:20.580
Please eat the Garlic Crab as this sashimi!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.680
It's got a strong scent, so 
please use this special sauce...

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.220
Thank you for the food!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.380
You jumped the gun again!

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:33.590
I've recovered all my strength!

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:36.220
With that, they receive 200 points!

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:41.900
I get it...

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:45.030
I see why you gave me the 
50-point Summer Whiskey

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:48.340
instead of a ten-point ingredient.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:52.410
The remaining eight cards have all been seen.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.640
Coco knows the ingredients 
and all their points.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:15:00.750
The remaining cards total 310 points.

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:06.750
Even if Toriko eats all of them, 
that brings them to 1100 points.

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:09.620
If they use the ingredient switching rule

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.760
with the joker ingredient Nitro Cherry,

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.430
it's possible for them to get

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.600
my 200-point Shock Lemon.

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:21.230
1300 points is more than enough 
for them to steal my victory.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.300
In theory, that is...

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:26.470
But that possibility is near zero.

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:30.210
After all, it's impossible for Toriko 
to eat all of the ingredients!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:36.350
I get to turn over the cards, 
too. I'm sure Coco knows that.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:41.420
The only way they can win this 
is by making me give up the game.

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:46.590
Coco's aim is forcing me to quit!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:53.170
Alright, Livebearer-sama's Summer 
Whiskey. Please finish it!

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:58.400
Summer Whiskey, said to make even the 
strongest of drinkers pass out...

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:03.540
Toriko could drink the whole thing, 
but you thought I couldn't?

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:09.380
Actually, this is my favorite!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.590
Oh, yes! That's right.

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:17.690
Hey! Gimme that...

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:22.460
Gotta have drinking snacks...

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.160
Cheese Cabbage!

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:26.870
That's...

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:32.040
...the ingredient Komatsu put out when 
Toriko was drinking the Summer Whiskey!

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:36.310
It breaks down strong alcohol

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:39.010
by increasing liver function.

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:42.980
It's the only ingredient that 
goes with Summer Whiskey.

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.120
It was a good drinking snack hint.

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:47.020
Thank you.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.090
How dare you?!

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.090
Hey!

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.660
Copying... That's low!

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:56.660
As they say, I drink to my victory.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:04.130
Livebearer-sama finished the Summer Whiskey!

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:07.140
He gets 50 points!

00:17:07.470 --> 00:17:08.340
Toriko...

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.140
I'm going to take an "out".

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.740
I want you to rest up 
for as long as possible.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:16.150
I don't need to take a break...

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:18.310
Numbers 11 and 14!

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:18.610
Sure.

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.420
The Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team is out!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:26.420
The turn goes to Livebearer-sama.

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.690
Oh, dear!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:31.930
Perhaps the damage done in the 
battle with Hanya Panda lingers?

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:37.600
In that case, I also 
choose numbers 11 and 14.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.470
O-U-T!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:43.570
I'm not letting you rest.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:46.310
Alright!

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:47.210
Here I go!

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:50.050
Numbers 15 and 51!

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:55.820
Oh, boy! A match with Dragonfire!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:18:00.720
Huh? I thought you were going 
to have Toriko relax...

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.120
Maybe you've become desperate?!

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.230
Just as planned...

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.700
I'll have him consume three ingredients 
in a row, one right after the other.

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:11.570
Toriko! Komatsu-kun! I'm counting on you!

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:15.670
Dragonfire tempura!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:19.770
I cooked them for a short time at 
high heat so they wouldn't explode.

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.240
Delicious!

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:25.480
Thank you for the food!

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:29.220
The Dragonfire has been consumed!

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:31.450
That's good for 30 points!

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:32.450
Number 12!

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:33.850
Number 41!

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.920
Another hit, this time with Troll Cheese!

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:41.430
It's a sharp cheese that's said to stink 
3,000 times more than blue cheese!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:45.430
It's an unlucky ingredient 
worth a paltry ten points!

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:49.370
If I put the Troll Cheese on a cracker,

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:52.170
take the jam-like pulp of an orange,

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.340
and top the cheese with the orange pulp,

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.580
I think it'll be easier to eat.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.510
It still stinks a little, but yummy!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:00.710
Thank you for the food!

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:02.220
Yeah!

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:04.750
The Troll Cheese has been consumed!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.650
They gain ten points!

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.390
Number 24 and 42!

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:17.330
T-There it is!

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.860
Nitro Cherries!

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:21.100
A Super-Special Preparation Ingredient!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:25.400
It's a hit with a joker ingredient that's 
also an unlucky ten-point ingredient!

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:29.670
Uh-oh! You got a match with that one?

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:31.240
Don't tell me you intend to eat it?

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:33.580
If he doesn't eat it...

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.110
...we can't win!

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.350
An ingredient that needs 
to be handled with care

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:44.960
since the slightest jostling 
will make it explode...

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:47.830
Here come the Nitro Cherries!

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:52.100
Bring it on.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:54.530
Exploding cherries,

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:56.470
I'm gonna eat you up!

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:01.140
I wonder if you'll be able to eat 
them and stay in one piece...

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:03.110
Nitro Cherries...

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:15.220
In those younger days,

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.150
No matter how you chased them,

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:21.730
The sky-spanning rainbows got away

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:25.030
After that, time passed

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.500
Were you able to grasp

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:32.140
The rainbow by the name of dreams then?

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:35.840
When it comes to a new challenge,

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:41.110
You turn into a coward,

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:46.580
But your chance ain't gonna wait on you,

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:51.450
So now's the time!

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:59.090
Bet those tears and that kindness

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:03.370
Will light up tomorrow

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:06.430
That's right, rainbows are 
all the more beautiful

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:10.270
Because we can't catch 'em

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:13.980
Today's Gourmet Tasting Lecture!

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:16.010
I'm your newscaster, Tina.

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.180
The game is nearing its conclusion!

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:22.550
Let's take a detailed look at the flow 
of today's game and its checkpoints!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.950
Toriko had a fierce fight with a Hanya Panda!

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:30.260
If only they'd let me be 
the announcer there...

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:34.230
It would've been a much, much livelier event!

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:37.030
Pardon me!

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:40.400
Toriko's team had 340 points

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:44.140
and Livebearer had 1,190 
points at the start today.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:57.950
Toriko gained 590 points by defeating 
and eating the Hanya Panda!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:00.720
The Hanya Panda was a joker ingredient,

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:03.960
so they traded Summer 
Whiskey for Garlic Crab!

00:22:10.860 --> 00:22:12.430
They both polished off those ingredients.

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:16.870
Toriko's team got 200 points 
and Livebearer got 50 points.

00:22:17.970 --> 00:22:20.670
After that, Coco had two hits in a row!

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:24.980
Toriko was able to eat both ingredients!

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:30.620
The Coco-Toriko-Komatsu 
team were up to 830 points

00:22:30.720 --> 00:22:33.050
when Coco made a match with Nitro Cherries!

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:36.620
And here's today's cool point!

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:41.060
Nitro Cherries are a dangerous ingredient,

00:22:41.060 --> 00:22:42.830
but they're also a joker ingredient,

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:44.560
so if Toriko can successfully eat them,

00:22:44.560 --> 00:22:48.730
he'll be able to trade for 
Livebearer's high-point card!

00:22:48.730 --> 00:22:51.070
Then they'd have a good chance 
of turning the game around!

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:57.910
But will Toriko be able to 
eat the Nitro Cherries?!

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:01.450
I'm feeling a heaping helping of excitement!

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:04.950
And now, on to the next segment!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:09.650
Toriko is on the ropes and Coco's at a disadvantage.

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:13.760
If the only card left is the joker, Team Toriko is in huge trouble!

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:16.760
Climax! the Last, Most Terrible Ingredients!

00:23:17.300 --> 00:23:18.980
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
